        "After the burn there is a lift that does not show floors, only a progress bar, as if the building were still embarrassed. Kane rides it with you whether you came in his car, left Helix for him, or grew a body back from a ghost. He looks like billing. He is a knife. Zero was right, which you will not thank them for.\n\n\"Price,\" he says. \"Not the burn. The next one. Helix will still hold a live test. They will use you as CHRYSALIS with a pulse. I want the protocol, the client list, the kill-switch. I wanted them six weeks ago. The calendar got loud. If you perform in their theater I will expect a copy of whatever they put in you. If you sabotage, I will expect the sabotage to leave a door. If you run, I will expect you to run toward a drawer that floods, not toward a suite with a fake dog.\"",
