        "At 03:10 you count because counting is armed. Civic units: late, performative, two arrests that will be released when the firms call. Helix casualties: a drone, a shooter whose name you do not have, a week's logs if you spent them. Revelations: a drop, a runner, a leak if you spent her, a van with a noodle wound. Civilian: a gurney gone quiet, a witness gone soft or quiet, a cousin's bag on a floor. You do not add yourself. You are still a variable.\n\nThe dossier in your head updates. Kane: appeared, invoiced, may vanish until an ending. Voss: staffing, not forgiving. Radek: bruise, offer, memory as leash. Marek: report, chase, teeth. Crowe: launch, lullaby. Vale: reconstruction, live test. Zero: neighbor, country, pear. Mia: unsaid, if you kept her that way. You stop counting before the numbers become a prayer you cannot pay. The cot creaks. Creaks are civilian. You keep this one.",
