        "The flower does not applaud. You hear yourself anyway: still theirs, still a liaison, still the person Kane recruited with a card in a locker. Saying it makes a shape you can walk inside. The shape is a leash. It is also a spine. You send Voss a single word — extractable — and she replies with a time and a door. You do not send Kane anything. He will bill the silence.\n\nHelix will still dress you. Belonging to Revelations does not cancel a theater. It only decides who you steal for when the lights dim. You put the pistol in the grocery bag that has survived a war. You wash your face until the ash leaves. Some of it stays in the tooth-cut. That is a relic. Relics are allowed. The grocery bag smells of rain and a pistol. You carry it like groceries anyway. Camouflage is a kind of prayer with handles.",
