        "Collection happens the way weather happens: decided, then wet. If you declared Revelations, Voss's door is a service lift and a sandwich that is not a vial. If you declared Helix, Lyle's car becomes a wardrobe corridor the color of teeth. If you declared no one, both find you near the clocks because of course they do; heat is a beacon and you lit it on purpose. In all versions you end the morning in a room with clothes on hangers labeled by affect: trust, appetite, apology, launch.\n\nA tailor of fifty-one, Helix contract, Revelations file, double in the only way that still gets paid, pins a garment to your shoulder and does not ask about the bruise. \"The client likes lines that look inherited,\" he says. \"Stand like you were born to the cloth. If you weren't, the cloth will lie for you. Cloth is older than CHRYSALIS and less ethical.\"",
        "You stand. The cloth lies. You let it, because the live test will require a body that can be read at ten meters. Vale enters without knocking, because knocking is for people who believe in rooms. \"You survived a street,\" he says. \"Survival is not the metric. Compliance in spectacle is the metric. Tonight or this afternoon, depending on Ives's committee. You will be touched. You will be asked to demonstrate rewrite, voice, scent, and sexual availability as wellness. You may refuse in the room. Refusal will become a slide. I am telling you so you do not waste the word surprise.\"\n\nHe looks at your hands. \"Zero asked me to write neighbor on your file. I wrote candidate. I am not a poet. Lyle is waiting with water. The water is still water. After the fittings, it may not matter.\"",
